<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Chicago Bridge started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Chicago Bridge started.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Goldman Sachs said on Thursday that its analyst Carey Callaghan started coverage of Chicago Bridge &amp; Iron Co NV by adding it to his recommended list.</p>
<p>-- Shares in the engineering and construction services company were up 1-1/8 to 21 in early trading.</p>
</text>
